WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.168 --> 00:00:02.160
- So you two bonded when you got

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.140
to Atlanta to film the movie, right?

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.000
- We did. We immediately got coffee

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.230
before we ever filmed,

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:08.820
because, you know, we
had never met outside

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:09.653
of the chemistry read.

00:00:09.653 --> 00:00:10.486
- Yeah.

00:00:10.486 --> 00:00:11.319
- But even after the chemistry read,

00:00:11.319 --> 00:00:13.260
I think it was so clear.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.910
The call that we came
after the chemistry read

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.590
from Jama was like, so it's cute, right?

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:17.520
I was right. Yeah, Yeah Okay.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.245
We're on the same page, cool, cool

00:00:19.245 --> 00:00:20.247
(laughter)

00:00:20.247 --> 00:00:21.080
And we were in Atlanta

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.400
and then we I was like, let's grab coffee.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.233
- Yeah

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:25.860
- We hung out for two, three, four hours.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.540
Walked around, found an art commune.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.660
- Yeah, we just stumbled
across this art commune and

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.233
in like this railroad area,

00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:34.260
and it was such a random moment.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.570
We were like silent for
like two minutes walking

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.620
just looking at everything.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.480
And then Noah just turns
to me and he's like,

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.081
Who let us be superheroes?

00:00:41.081 --> 00:00:41.914
(laughter)

00:00:41.914 --> 00:00:44.250
And then we just started
dying and that was kind of

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.879
like the start of just this
beautiful like relationship

00:00:47.879 --> 00:00:50.118
and just like friendship,
you know, with Noah.

00:00:50.118 --> 00:00:52.262
Couldn't be more thankful for it.

00:00:52.262 --> 00:00:53.095
- Yeah.

00:00:53.095 --> 00:00:53.977
(applause)

